Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/list.c
Line: 976
Function: collect_asymciph
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: sk_EVP_ASYM_CIPHER_new() in list_asymciphers() (line 983) is not checked for NULL. If allocation fails, the NULL asym_cipher_stack is passed to EVP_ASYM_CIPHER_do_all_provided() and then to collect_asymciph(), where sk_EVP_ASYM_CIPHER_push(asym_cipher_stack, asym_cipher) dereferences the NULL pointer.

